For certain functions, standardised telephone numbers shall be implemented. These 
functions are: (M) 
-     Route call to most appropriate ERTMS/ETCS RBC; 
-     Railway emergency call; 
-     Route call to primary controller; 
-     Route call to secondary controller; 
-     Route call to power supply controller; 
-     Public emergency call.

